<title>USA: PanAmSat completes merger with Hughes.</title>
<headline>PanAmSat completes merger with Hughes.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>PanAmSat Corp on Friday said its merger with the Galaxy Satellite Services business of Hughes Electronics Corp has been completed, and the new company, called PanAmSat Corp, will list its common stock on Nasdaq on May 19.</p>
<p>The satellite service operations company will trade initially under the ticker SPOTD. The ticker will revert to SPOT after 30 days.</p>
<p>PanAmSat said its shareholders formally approved the merger on May 8.</p>
